  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anticipating &amp; Disrupting Environmental Crime in the Globalized Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An integrated supply-chain approach to reducing organized crime, threat financing and security threats relating to environmental crime, using proven strategies to counter trafficking updated for a contemporary context of criminal economies in fragile states in the cyber age. The initiative targets the Congo basin and Swahili coast, with potential expansion to the Golden Triangle in Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
